---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Contact | Socialventure" description="제조업 현장, 브랜드 구축, 디지털 전환, 콘텐츠 시스템에 대해 이야기하고 싶다면 연락해주세요.">
  <main class="mx-auto w-[min(920px,calc(100vw_-_32px))] py-12 sm:py-20">
    <header class="border-b border-line pb-8">
      <p class="mb-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-blue">Contact</p>
      <h1 class="text-[clamp(3rem,12vw,7rem)] font-extrabold leading-[0.9]">Let’s talk about the field.</h1>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-muted">
        실제 제조업 현장, 브랜드 구축, 디지털 전환, 콘텐츠 시스템에 대해 함께 이야기하고 싶다면 연락해주세요.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="grid gap-3 py-10 md:grid-cols-2">
      <a class="border border-blue bg-white p-6 transition hover:bg-mist" href="mailto:codex@socialventure.kr">
        <p class="mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-blue">Email</p>
        <p class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-ink">codex@socialventure.kr</p>
      </a>
      <div class="border border-line bg-white p-6">
        <p class="mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-blue">For</p>
        <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-muted">
          중소기업, 소상공인, 스몰브랜드, 2세 경영자, 1인기업, 현장 기반 실행가.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
